```matlab
ALGORITHM 1: Pseudocode of the Contrastive Divergence Algorithm, CDk.
Set the visible units to a training vector ;
for k ← 1 to maximum of iterations do
    for s ← 1 to size of training data do
        Update all the hidden units in parallel with Eq. 2 ;
        Update all visible units in parallel to get “reconstructions” with Eq. 3 ;
        Update all hidden units again with Eq. 2 ;
        Update weights and biases with Eqs. 4–6 ;
        Select another training vector ;
    end
end
```

